  (116, 1852, 'drug_exposure', 'unspecified', FALSE, 'Angiotensin converting enzyme inhibitors • Potassium sparing diuretics Strong CYP3A Inhibitors Tolvaptan''s AUC was 5.4 times as large and C max was 3.5 times as large after co-administration of tolvaptan and 200 mg ketoconazole'),
