  (278, 1728, 'drug_exposure', 'decrease', FALSE, 'When the Butorphanol Tartrate Nasal Spray was administered 30 minutes after the sumatriptan nasal spray, the AUC of butorphanol increased 11% and C max decreased 18%.'),
