  (480, 1653, 'hypotension', 'increase', FALSE, 'PDE-5 inhibitors : sildenafil, vardenafil, tadalafil ↑ PDE-5 inhibitors (only the use of sildenafil at doses used for treatment of erectile dysfunction has been studied with PREZISTA/ritonavir) Co-administration with PREZISTA/ritonavir may result in an increase in PDE-5 inhibitor-associated adverse events, including hypotension, syncope, visual disturbances and priapism.'),
