  (1026, 1436, 'drug_exposure', 'increase', FALSE, 'Drugs that induce CYP3A activity (e.g., phenobarbital, rifampin, rifabutin) would be expected to increase the clearance of EFV resulting in lowered plasma concentrations.'),
