  (1291, 1582, 'hypotension', 'unspecified', TRUE, 'Concomitant use of Nitroglycerin in 5% Dextrose Injection with riociguat, a soluble guanylate cyclase stimulator, can cause hypotension and is contraindicated (see Contraindications ).'),
  (1291, 1653, 'hypotension', 'unspecified', TRUE, 'Concomitant use of Nitroglycerin in 5% Dextrose Injection with phosphodiesterase inhibitors (e.g. sildenafil, tadalafil, or vardenafil) can cause hypotension and is contraindicated (see Contraindications ).'),
